{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54247","headline":"六合怀古诗 废士林馆 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 废士林馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"士林馆侧尽儒流，朝士庄田隔近陬。\n见说人稀难驻泊，于今荆棘走獐麀。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》题注：「《嘉定志》：士林馆在竹镇，其地习儒业，多仕官。\n郏滂时馆已废。\n」〖2〗《光绪志》诗末注：「士林馆在竹镇，地多习儒业。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}